  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rvnm](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rvnm) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 65.905 depth occurred on Dec 18 2025 117km E of Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 52.9652 longitude 159.6969. It impacted 186 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
